From 1d0ee0b19b81633050ba112be35126b7af33941c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 10:30:58 -0300
